{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>葉蒨文（Sophie）與曾展望（GM）憑藉節目《女神配對計劃》人氣急升！兩人自節目中成功配對後感情一直非常穩定，「GS」CP 深受網民喜愛與支持！</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_e8d476a554721fda-994\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>不經不覺，兩人迎來拍拖一周年紀念！葉蒨文日前在社交平台晒出一輯與 GM 甜蜜撐枱腳的靚相放閃！相中的 Sophie 身穿黑色吊帶晚裝，在「男友視角」下對鏡嘟嘴賣萌，眼神盡是甜蜜。餐盤上更寫有「Happy Anniversary」字樣，現場粉紅泡泡滿瀉！</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_e8d476a554721fda-995\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>帖文一出，大批網民紛紛送上祝福：「開心開心，咁就一年嘞，永遠幸福快樂」、「我嘅女神繼續幸幸福福」，好姊妹李芷晴亦留言：「Happy GS Day！」。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_e8d476a554721fda-995\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"0fc3870d-0450-4dc6-9efe-210ab907cf7f.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026T9SnE7xaNf1790067562.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"0fc3870d-0450-4dc6-9efe-210ab907cf7f.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4c2ea45c-f60f-4239-9cf1-65a0ee7aea61.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026J7ep9jeGOJ1790067562.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4c2ea45c-f60f-4239-9cf1-65a0ee7aea61.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_e8d476a554721fda-996\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>其實，兩人私下的甜爆互動遠不止於此！日前 GM 出席《試真D唷》活動時，Sophie 便特意變裝化身小粉絲到現場力撐男友。事後 Sophie 分享這段「追星」體驗：「小鹿亂撞好緊張，等個星出黎嚟感覺！」</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_e8d476a554721fda-997\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>當被問及看到現場大批粉絲支持 GM 有何感想時，Sophie 更揮動手中的應援物，甜絲絲地表示：「好開心同埋好自豪！」，吸引網民狂讚：「好稱職嘅迷妹啊」、「連美儀姐都差啲認唔到你」！</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_e8d476a554721fda-997\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_e8d476a554721fda-997\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"57e2d036-ad3d-4ac4-be45-8795a1190424.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026IMPUg0NOoa1790067561.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"57e2d036-ad3d-4ac4-be45-8795a1190424.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-22T14:18:48.304467+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":470,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}